Modifications: Go reimplementation of selected portable SDK customizations,
Go-specific HTTP and slog integration, bounded start-callsite capture,
standard Go ratio sampler, explicit local sending controls, protocol selection,
OTLP gRPC exporters, and HTTP/JSON transport adapters for metrics and logs.
This is not an official Elastic product and is not supported by Elastic.

This Go implementation uses OpenTelemetry Go and OpenTelemetry Go Contrib,
Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Transitive dependencies retain their respective notices and licenses in the
Go module cache. No Java JVM agent, ASM, async-profiler, or okhttp code is
included in this implementation.

Local Docker Compose configuration derived from elastic/start-local,
Copyright Elasticsearch B.V. and/or licensed to Elasticsearch B.V., Apache-2.0.
Source revision: 0a56d370042dc6d5032026b0173c93e94f2f1676.
Modifications: loopback-only collector ports, Basic license, Kibana telemetry
opt-out, random-secret preparation, and non-destructive stop command.

Consistent56 sampler behavior adapted from OpenTelemetry Java Contrib
consistent-sampling, Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, Apache-2.0.
Reference version: opentelemetry-consistent-sampling 1.61.0-alpha.
https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-contrib/tree/v1.61.0/consistent-sampling
Go adaptation includes W3C vendor state parsing, 56-bit thresholds,
parent decisions and dynamic delegate replacement.

OpAMP remote configuration uses OpenTelemetry opamp-go, Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/open-telemetry/opamp-go
Elastic configuration key names follow the referenced EDOT Java source.
